### Q47. [TCS 2024] Ram walks 5 km East, turns right and walks 3 km, turns right and walks 5 km. Which direction is he facing?

**Approach:**
```
Start → 5km East → Turn Right (South)
→ 3km South → Turn Right (West)
→ 5km West → STOP
```
- Facing: **West**
- Distance from start: 3 km South (directly south)

