## TOPIC 2.5: SEATING ARRANGEMENT

### Approach (Linear)
1. Read all conditions first
2. Fix one person's position as anchor
3. Use "left/right" relative to person sitting (NOT your view)
4. Process definite clues first, then conditional

### Approach (Circular)
1. Fix one person (eliminates rotation issues)
2. clockwise = right; anticlockwise = left
3. In circular: opposite = n/2 positions away

