## TOPIC 2.8: CLOCK & CALENDAR

### Clock Concept
- Minute hand: 360°/60 min = 6°/min
- Hour hand: 360°/12 hr = 0.5°/min
- Angle = |30H − 5.5M| (where H=hour, M=minutes)
- Hands overlap: every 12/11 hours ≈ 65.45 min
- Hands at 180°: every 12/11 hours (offset from overlap)

### Calendar Concept
- Odd days: Mon=1, Tue=2, ... Sun=0
- Normal year: 365 = 52 weeks + 1 odd day
- Leap year: 366 = 52 weeks + 2 odd days
- Leap year: divisible by 4 (but not 100 unless 400)
- 400 years = 0 odd days

