# QUICK REVISION: FORMULAE & SHORTCUTS

## Speed Math Tricks for TCS NQT

### Multiplication Shortcuts
- **Multiply by 11:** 23 × 11 → 2_(2+3)_3 = **253**
- **Multiply by 5:** n × 5 = n/2 × 10 → 48 × 5 = 24 × 10 = **240**
- **Multiply by 25:** n × 25 = n/4 × 100 → 48 × 25 = 12 × 100 = **1200**
- **Multiply by 9:** n × 9 = n × 10 − n → 37 × 9 = 370 − 37 = **333**
- **Square of number ending in 5:** 75² → 7×8=56, append 25 → **5625**

### Percentage ↔ Fraction Quick Reference
| % | Fraction | | % | Fraction |
|---|----------|---|---|----------|
| 10% | 1/10 | | 12.5% | 1/8 |
| 20% | 1/5 | | 16.67% | 1/6 |
| 25% | 1/4 | | 33.33% | 1/3 |
| 50% | 1/2 | | 66.67% | 2/3 |
| 75% | 3/4 | | 37.5% | 3/8 |

### Key Number Properties
- Sum of first n natural numbers = n(n+1)/2
- Sum of squares = n(n+1)(2n+1)/6
- Sum of cubes = [n(n+1)/2]²
- nCr = nC(n−r)
- (a+b)² = a² + 2ab + b²
- (a−b)² = a² − 2ab + b²
- a² − b² = (a+b)(a−b)

### Time-Saving Rules
| Concept | Shortcut |
|---------|----------|
| Same % profit & loss on same SP | Always loss, Loss% = x²/100 |
| Two successive discounts a% & b% | Equivalent = a + b − ab/100 |
| Average speed (equal distances) | 2ab/(a+b) |
| CI−SI difference (2 years) | P(R/100)² |
| Radius ↑ by x%, Area ↑ by | 2x + x²/100 |
| Side ↑ by x%, Area ↑ by | 2x + x²/100 |
| If population grows by R% yearly | P(1+R/100)^n |

