# EXAM DAY STRATEGY

1. **Attempt easy questions first** — no negative marking means attempt ALL
2. **Spend max 1.5 min per question** — skip if stuck, return later
3. **Numerical: ~1.5 min/Q** → Do percentage, average, ratio first (quick)
4. **Reasoning: ~1.7 min/Q** → Series & coding-decoding first (fastest)
5. **Verbal: ~1.25 min/Q** → RC last (time-consuming), grammar first
6. **Use elimination** — remove 2 options, guess between remaining
7. **Approximate** — TCS options are usually spaced apart, exact calc often unnecessary
8. **Don't get stuck on one question** — move on after 2 minutes max
